  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2209.07 Procedures for Hearings. All hearings conducted under this chapter shall be in\n\naccordance with the department's administrative procedural and hearing rules, Saf-C 200.\n\nSource. #9484 eff 6-19-09; ss by #12513, eff 4-12-18\n\nAPPENDIX",
